<section>
<div class="runline">seed 42 · ..&#x2f;..&#x2f;target&#x2f;debug&#x2f;homegrown_cart</div>
<h1>3 problems in 300 carts</h1>
<p class="lede">Each problem below is shrunk to the smallest cart that still shows it.</p>
<dl class="meta">
<div><dt>Engine</dt><dd class="mono">..&#x2f;..&#x2f;target&#x2f;debug&#x2f;homegrown_cart</dd></div>
<div><dt>Runner</dt><dd>command, no shell</dd></div>
<div><dt>Seed</dt><dd class="mono">42</dd></div>
<div><dt>Carts</dt><dd>300, plus 180 twins for the split, reorder and add checks</dd></div>
<div><dt>Runs</dt><dd>552 runs, including 7 to shrink</dd></div>
</dl>
</section>




